# Line-ending policy for the orchestration kit.
# Author: maintained with Claude Code for the frontier-model orchestration setup.
#
# Why: codex-delegate.mjs inlines the role docs and contracts byte-for-byte into the
# worker prompt. With core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows default) a checkout would turn
# LF into CRLF and silently change every delegated prompt. Force LF on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
